  "description": "<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Metto State is a lifestyle apparel brand inspired by the natural beauty and laid-back vibes of the Lowcountry. Based on the coastal culture of South Carolina, our brand embodies the spirit of adventure, relaxation, and community that define life by the shore. From the iconic palmetto trees to the gentle salt marshes, our designs celebrate the unique charm of this region.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">At Metto State, we believe that your clothing should reflect not only where you&rsquo;re from but where you love to be. That&rsquo;s why our apparel is crafted with high-quality, comfortable fabrics, perfect for every day&mdash;from beach outings to boat trips and everything in between. Whether you&rsquo;re exploring the coast or just hanging with friends, our pieces are made to keep you stylish and comfortable.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">With a focus on premium quality and coastal-inspired designs, we invite you to take the Lowcountry lifestyle with you wherever you go. Join us at Metto State and become part of a community that celebrates the simple pleasures and timeless beauty of coastal living. From t-shirts to long sleeves, every piece tells a story of life on the coast.</span></p>",
